# The standalone installer carries the game's own 22 MB of data. It is built
# from the tree on disk by toolchain/port/build_release.py and handed to the
# user directly; it is not something to push to a remote.
build/Asphalt2-S60v3-*.sis

# What build_release.py leaves in build/ beside the package: object files, the
# linked images at both load addresses, and the resources the packager folds
# into the SIS. All of it is regenerated by the next build from the sources in
# toolchain/port, so none of it belongs in the record -- the .sis does.
build/*.o
build/*.elf
build/*.bin
build/*.exe
build/*.ld
build/*.rsc
build/*.mbm
build/*.mif
build/*_install.txt
